# =====================================================================
# DecoShop Plan V2 — Environment template
# Copy this file to `.env.local` then fill in your real values.
# `.env.local` is gitignored (*.local) — never commit your anon key.
# =====================================================================

# --------- Supabase (project `decoshop`) ---------
# Source of truth for the inventory: contains the `public.articles` table.
# Plan V2 adds `plan_sections` / `plan_zones` / `plan_shelves` /
# `plan_shelf_items` to this same `public` schema (see sql/001_plan_tables.sql).
#
# Dashboard: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/dzjebcipoqgjvxxmlcry
# Settings → API → copy the anon (public) key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://dzjebcipoqgjvxxmlcry.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# --------- One-time setup (after filling above) ---------
# 1) SQL Editor → run sql/001_plan_tables.sql (idempotent, additive).
# 2) The migration uses RLS allowing anon read/write — see header comment
#    in the SQL file for the threat model.
